@FEAT-003
Feature: Cart management # validation/features/cart_management.feature:2
  As a customer
  I want to add, remove, and adjust items in my cart
  So that I can manage my order before checkout
  @TC-009 @US-005 @positive @high
  Scenario: Add a dish to the cart                         # validation/features/cart_management.feature:8
    Given the meal "Salmon Roll" is available              # validation/features/steps/application_steps.py:18
    When the customer taps "Add to cart" on "Salmon Roll"  # validation/features/steps/application_steps.py:18
    Then "Salmon Roll" appears in the cart with quantity 1 # validation/features/steps/application_steps.py:62
    And the cart total is updated "10.00" to include it    # validation/features/steps/application_steps.py:67

  @TC-010 @US-005 @negative @high
  Scenario: Attempt to add an unavailable item                       # validation/features/cart_management.feature:15
    Given the meal "Salmon Roll" is marked unavailable               # None
    When the customer attempts to add "Salmon Roll" to the cart      # None
    Then the item is not added to the cart                           # None
    And the customer sees a message that it is currently unavailable # None

  @TC-011 @US-007 @positive @medium
  Scenario: Increase and decrease item quantity                        # validation/features/cart_management.feature:22
    Given "Salmon Roll" is already in the cart with quantity 1         # None
    When the customer increases the quantity by 2                      # None
    And the customer decreases the quantity by 1                       # None
    Then the cart shows "Salmon Roll" with quantity 2                  # None
    And the cart total is recalculated automatically after each change # None

  @TC-012 @US-006 @edge @medium
  Scenario: Decrease quantity to zero removes the item               # validation/features/cart_management.feature:30
    Given "Salmon Roll" is the only item in the cart with quantity 1 # None
    When the customer decreases the quantity to 0                    # None
    Then "Salmon Roll" is removed from the cart entirely             # None
    And the cart total updates to zero                               # None

  @TC-013 @US-005 @positive @high
  Scenario: Cart persists after a page reload                               # validation/features/cart_management.feature:37
    Given the customer has added an item to the cart in the current session # None
    When the customer reloads the page                                      # None
    Then the cart still shows the same items and quantities                 # None

  @TC-014 @negative @high
  Scenario: Reject an item from a different restaurant without changing the cart  # validation/features/cart_management.feature:43
    Given the cart contains an item from "Sushi Place"                            # None
    When the customer attempts to add an item from "Pizza Corner"                 # None
    Then the app blocks the action                                                # None
    And the existing cart remains unchanged                                       # None

